Required requirement format:
  The system shall <action>.
  The system shall <action> when <condition>.
  The system shall <action> if <condition>.
  The system shall <action> while <state>.
  The system shall <action> where <feature> is configured.
RULES:
  • Every requirement MUST start with 'The system shall'.
  • Place any conditions AFTER the shall-clause.
  • Exactly ONE 'shall' per sentence.